  <item>
    <title>五行八字、能量水晶……玄学是当代中女的情绪自救吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c322addb5e6d6bf968727c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c322addb5e6d6bf968727c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Aug 2024 10:47:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们的第二期播客，磕磕绊绊，完成上线。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客，我们选择玄学作为切入点，起因是观察到身边的人都会在某一刻出现玄学血脉的觉醒。但聊着聊着我们发现，我们对于玄学的需求依然是一种对环境的回应，因为身处复杂时代的我们，要比以往都更需要找到可以依赖的全新叙事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在对谈中也分享了自己的一些玄学体验，在我们所造的这套叙事里：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>下大雨的天气是在为八字喜水的人充能</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>一个爹味懂王只是因为海底轮能量堵塞</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>佩戴捷克陨石的特惠快车司机开车更快一些</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>这些观察无从求证，但也并不重要。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果注定无法改变环境，至少，我们还能选择为自己搭建一个心理避难所，在与内心的联结中，找到平静与力量。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【你将听到】</span></strong></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> </span></em><span>第二期终于做出来了</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">03:45</a> </span></em><span>我们用小六壬算了第一期的数据</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> </span></em><span>求财手机壳与显化头像</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a> </span></em><span>算命不准？因为球运变了！</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1393">23:13</a> </span></em><span>寻求答案是因为内心的无力感</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1621">27:01</a> </span></em><span>盘水晶的快乐：从情绪消费到再创造的乐趣</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a> 偶遇一位佩戴捷克陨石的快车师傅</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3026">50:26</a> 打造自己的心理避难所</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3794">1:03:14</a> </span></em><span>用小某书学来的知识给人看八字</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">1:13:00</a> </span></em><span>脉轮：一套回归自身的玄学体系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4812">1:20:12</a> 脉轮体系的妙用：突然看穿那些讨厌的人</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5070">1:24:30</a> </span></em><span>科学也是一套人造价值体系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5346">1:29:06</a> 不停地追求金钱，就像不断在“挣锄头”</span></li><span></span></ol><span></span><p><strong><span>【也子的手工作品及收藏】</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnn3_2IuQWd4Gv8-P58kr27eDOOU.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foeb6jc0Y2Vwa3T_JoRThKqcPggA.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnoKEjPrmFYc_AZIqrvkU9ucGK49.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoxkHKPnD-yjw997jo_uiNNzTzil.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkc_XWqc_rSc3-7cln4NGLVNAwrZ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmQG-DeM4hpnjjjIJ_EbQypWFI_H.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiVGYNeQ_UBI6E4wIqIoJfpTBGvn.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft1HdOjAiRlqrVRlPrdLf9BFXLlg.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flrbv_-J4ovnj0Ck7Tla0TDx_1LU.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo7QemoTN3C4wYWhW3nnx4LtRFWV.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtGIhatRPpqfl7VaiyHU1WFK_ycF.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr_IHpyXDRhqWL-3TaOnESyi3_sW.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn7C-lXO-o49XsL0XR6RFc8SgvdE.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjnAcMlpEkEb66TN6JdHyR4aK9X9.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>也子的脉轮笔记：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrlowfuT0orokxXzw3nR1xxmdZ6g.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtO0lrdaeul8XZKWm-688LiByKs7.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>《降世神童》里讲到的脉轮原理：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>64 【如何清理、激活、开启七脉轮一次讲透！ - 33巨富 | 小红书 - 你的生活指南】 😆 yJXlfq5QqxTkHLB 😆 </span><a href="http://xhslink.com/lJidMT" data-url="http://xhslink.com/lJidMT"><span>xhslink.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>水晶：ENFP，前外企PR，现创业公司六边形战士，资深帝都打工人，爱好饮酒与社交的园艺新手</span></p><span></span><p><span>也子：aka mc也子，前都市丽人（已脱美役），体制内摸鱼小能手，两只猫的母亲，正在成为女巫的路上默默耕耘</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们也开通了小红书账号</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60cf07c50000000001004a77" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60cf07c50000000001004a77"><span>精神来也</span></a><span>，欢迎关注留言~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【关于我们】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>30多岁的两位女性好友，水晶和也子，想要在这里聊一聊关于女性成长的二三事（主要是自我暴露）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听女人说话，说女人的话，记录下我们的能量流动，从各自的能量场中伸出触角，相互访问。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢【Keyone studio】的场地与设备支持。</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：Human Spirit-Dolores O'Riordan</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;I Drink Wine-Adele</span></p>]]></description>
